      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can\u0027t tell what this is highlighting to ask about reserved fields / hide definition.\n\nIf this is about the AIMapperV5 struct itself, the size is expected/required to be frozen. Additions would be a version bump + an `AIMapperV\u003cnext\u003e` struct.",
